# BLAS++ and LAPACK++ for every build lane: installers/install.sh, the Windows
# provisioner, the CI workflows and actions, and docker/tsan all read this file.
#
# Format: one KEY=value per line, no quotes, no spaces, no `export`; lines
# starting with # are comments. Each *_REF is authoritative: a full 40-character
# commit hash, fetched by hash. Each *_TAG names the tag that points at that
# commit, or is empty while there is none; CI checks that the two agree and
# that each *_REF exists at its *_URL.
#
# The URLs are the BallisticLA forks, which carry BLAS++/LAPACK++ fixes not yet
# merged upstream (see BALLISTIC.md in each fork). RandLAPACK's copy of this
# file must pin exactly what the one in its RandBLAS submodule pins; CI fails
# otherwise.
BLASPP_URL=https://github.com/BallisticLA/blaspp.git
BLASPP_REF=f84bc922c837bd9728649befaf610799322a1e72
BLASPP_TAG=
LAPACKPP_URL=https://github.com/BallisticLA/lapackpp.git
LAPACKPP_REF=09c3a15b81977d98565a84c971e0c0f1391b3609
LAPACKPP_TAG=
